                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9798c065-a6e2-32fc-bbed-2c0ddd0dcf58",
                        "entry_id": "e1e86484-c579-32cb-a3dc-c984fcbbe4f6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "утратить навыки, умение делать что-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "da8581db-7216-4c25-94b8-46a2929e9b09",
                        "source_entry_id": "e1e86484-c579-32cb-a3dc-c984fcbbe4f6",
                        "source_sense_id": "9798c065-a6e2-32fc-bbed-2c0ddd0dcf58",
                        "target_lang_word": "forget",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "forget",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a4ffff9-3369-3fe7-b8ad-7df4b2164ebd",
                                        "entry_id": "7a318fb3-bd14-304b-b857-8d7ccab632f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To lose remembrance of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e00823cc-026f-4e51-a5f0-ccf586e821d7",
                                                "sense_id": "8a4ffff9-3369-3fe7-b8ad-7df4b2164ebd",
                                                "text": "I have forgotten most of the things I learned in school."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a6c96f4-b528-4b9d-954a-d7b1180654e6",
                                                "sense_id": "8a4ffff9-3369-3fe7-b8ad-7df4b2164ebd",
                                                "text": "VVe (of all earthlings) are Gods vtmoſt ſubiects, the laſt (in a manner) that he bought to his obedience: ſhal we then forgette that vvee are any ſubiects of hys, becauſe (as amongſt his Angels) he is not viſibly conuerſant amongſt vs?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b19a97bf-3811-4b3d-adf9-197c25842b87",
                                                "sense_id": "8a4ffff9-3369-3fe7-b8ad-7df4b2164ebd",
                                                "text": "For at least two hours the Boy loved him, and then Aunts and Uncles came to dinner, and there was a great rustling of tissue paper and unwrapping of parcels, and in the excitement of looking at all the new presents the Velveteen Rabbit was forgotten."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2cc99f1-e27c-4f32-bf92-36d778ea55d1",
                                                "sense_id": "8a4ffff9-3369-3fe7-b8ad-7df4b2164ebd",
                                                "text": "Technical terms like ferrite, perlite, graphite, and hardenite were bandied to and fro, and when Paget glibly brought out such a rare exotic as ferro-molybdenum, Benson forgot that he was a master ship-builder,[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6151db77-4f07-4dd7-b9b5-030fd5401f57",
                                                "sense_id": "8a4ffff9-3369-3fe7-b8ad-7df4b2164ebd",
                                                "text": "Everybody, old and young, laughs uproariously at this and immediately forgets all about it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebdfd73a-62e2-406f-827a-d5ba6669d175",
                                                "sense_id": "8a4ffff9-3369-3fe7-b8ad-7df4b2164ebd",
                                                "text": "In conditions of unlimited global-digital 'web-memory' (labelled by one critic a 'globital age'), social remembering and forgetting have become functions of algorithm-based search technologies that mine data from users […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc700143-632d-3be4-904b-380d603fdbe4",
                                        "entry_id": "7a318fb3-bd14-304b-b857-8d7ccab632f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To unintentionally not do, neglect."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "691a3b73-d130-4a32-8b1c-0352cbbd6644",
                                                "sense_id": "fc700143-632d-3be4-904b-380d603fdbe4",
                                                "text": "I forgot to buy flowers for my wife at our 14th wedding anniversary."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb452ac4-ef6d-43d3-b481-58e5dd0fc831",
                                                "sense_id": "fc700143-632d-3be4-904b-380d603fdbe4",
                                                "text": "Pray, thou, therefore, to Slid, and forget not Slid, and it may be that Slid will not forget to send thee Death when most thou needest it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d189e3a-0b22-3db5-8d5d-b520dac01e25",
                                        "entry_id": "7a318fb3-bd14-304b-b857-8d7ccab632f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To unintentionally leave something behind."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23658ba8-4800-4da9-be87-4ba92668827a",
                                                "sense_id": "2d189e3a-0b22-3db5-8d5d-b520dac01e25",
                                                "text": "I forgot my car keys in the living room."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "343ffb37-1a6a-34f4-8abf-2c046987b108",
                                        "entry_id": "7a318fb3-bd14-304b-b857-8d7ccab632f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cease remembering."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9e7f490-66e2-4dcd-9e21-ed686014c0e2",
                                                "sense_id": "343ffb37-1a6a-34f4-8abf-2c046987b108",
                                                "text": "Let's just forget I ever told you anything about it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a49548e-fa23-43ff-99dc-4647fb48b06f",
                                                "sense_id": "343ffb37-1a6a-34f4-8abf-2c046987b108",
                                                "text": "He forgot having already visited this city."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "204f571d-1163-3c10-9344-1c8b54f7fd91",
                                        "entry_id": "7a318fb3-bd14-304b-b857-8d7ccab632f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To not realize something (regardless of whether one has ever known it)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "informal",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cae506b1-52a7-48bb-89c1-1c8c05ad2230",
                                                "sense_id": "204f571d-1163-3c10-9344-1c8b54f7fd91",
                                                "text": "People forget how much work goes into what we do."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ecbfed68-dceb-3181-ad89-353040f56419",
                                        "entry_id": "7a318fb3-bd14-304b-b857-8d7ccab632f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Euphemism for fuck, screw (a mild oath)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "110ed4ab-fdbc-4569-b3e1-e5261ad519d0",
                                                "sense_id": "ecbfed68-dceb-3181-ad89-353040f56419",
                                                "text": "Forget you!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
